#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1301 expect=skipped domain=TD
#note "Pins the absent-column contract: BroadcastFold keeps a bare empty(X) as a broadcast TRUE on a wholly-absent column, so the authored 'not empty(TDSTOFF)' broadcasts FALSE and kills the whole top-level AND - the rule EXECUTES and is silent. Was noViolation before the phase-4 hoist: the rule carries no Requirements.Variables gate. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TD class="TRIAL DESIGN"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TDORDER  type=Num
col TDANCVAR type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TD | 1 | RSSTDTC
